From: FractalCR <build@fractalcr.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] runtime: attach blockfile root filesystems without host mounting

Avoid simultaneous host and guest ext4 ownership for containerd blockfile roots.
Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/runtime/pkg/containerd-shim-v2/create.go
+++ b/src/runtime/pkg/containerd-shim-v2/create.go
@@ -347,6 +347,10 @@
